<%# Saccade, 2026-11-24 (v3): signature = full Saccade Media House logo (public/saccade-media-house-logo.png) and saccadeproduction.com.
    v2: no logo on top of the e-mail (mail apps already show the sender's logo there); instead a signature
    at the bottom of every e-mail (invitation, signed, copy of documents, code): Saccade mark | SACCADE PRODUCTION, saccadeproduction.com.
    The mark is a PNG, not SVG: Gmail and Outlook do not show SVG. File: public/saccade-mail-mark.png (mounted).
    Modification of DocuSeal 3.3.8 (AGPL-3.0); source: https://github.com/warlock9k00/docuseal-saccade.
    The Saccade logo is its owner's trademark and is not licensed under AGPL. %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title></title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <style></style>
  </head>
  <body dir="<%= TextUtils.rtl?(yield) ? 'rtl' : 'auto' %>">
    <%= yield %>
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" dir="ltr" style="margin:28px 0 0;border-collapse:collapse">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:0;vertical-align:middle"><a href="https://saccadeproduction.com" style="text-decoration:none"><img src="https://sign.context.select/saccade-media-house-logo.png" alt="Saccade Media House" width="169" height="26" style="display:block;border:0;outline:none;width:169px;height:26px"></a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:8px 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3"><a href="https://saccadeproduction.com" style="color:#1E252D;text-decoration:underline">saccadeproduction.com</a></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <%= render partial: 'shared/mailer_attribution' %>
  </body>
</html>
